      "message": "Merge main into issue/545-sinker-side-burn (kinds, params, stamp, gates, posting, setup sheet, tests: keep both sides)\n\nWire contour (#532) and the side burn (#545) sit side by side: ordinals\nWireContour 41, SinkerBurn 42, SinkerSideBurn 43 (digest tag 43), 44 kinds,\nthe side burn arms added beside the wire arms, sinker_gate kept next to\ntool_door / wire_gate, stamp keeps the side-gap term while main's stamp_tool\nowns the tool terms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
